ife Financial Inc. was founded in 1871 and is headquartered in Toronto, Canada.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Kevin David Strain C.A., CPA | President, CEO & Director | Age 59 | Compensation: $2.5M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 32K people. Revenue per employee of $922K ranks in the above the sector median among Financial Services peers. Each employee generates $58K of free cash flow annually. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Sun Life Financial Inc. is a large-cap financial services business with a $39.7B market cap on $29.7B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +19% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 21% against a 8% cost of capital \u2014 a 13-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $1.9B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 6 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, with adequate 0.74\u00d7 cash conversion.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 10.1\u00d7.","Management returns a meaningful 6.7% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.5\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 32% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.31828679185692},{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Operating margins 16% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 205% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","25 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Sun Life Financial (TSE:SLF) Stock Rating Cut to \u201cHold\u201d at TD Securities","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/sun-life-financial-tseslf-stock-rating-cut-to-hold-at-td-securities.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793968668.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.848,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Sun Life Financial (NYSE:SLF) Stock Bumped Down to \u201cSector Perform\u201d by National Bank Financial","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/sun-life-financial-nyseslf-stock-bumped-down-to-sector-perform-by-national-bank